===Noun===
{{en-noun|p}}

# {{lb|en|computing}} The [[representation]] and [[manipulation]] of [[pictorial]] [[data]] by a [[computer]].
# {{lb|en|computing}} The various [[technologies]] used to create and manipulate such pictorial data.
# {{lb|en|computing}} The [[image]]s so produced.
# {{lb|en|computing}} A sub-field of [[computer science]] which studies methods for digitally synthesizing and manipulating visual content.

